to music to just be my album.

00:04:11.017 --> 00:04:14.086
I just got to focus
on a couple of more songs

00:04:14.086 --> 00:04:16.122
and do music videos,

00:04:16.122 --> 00:04:18.223
and, you know, do the whole
whoop-de-hoo,

00:04:18.223 --> 00:04:21.627
so it's like, "Aw, man."
We just gotta make sure.

00:04:21.627 --> 00:04:24.097
-Is it tough, with
the pandemic and everything,

00:04:24.097 --> 00:04:28.767
to do, even to record a song,
let alone do a video for it?

00:04:28.767 --> 00:04:30.503
-Videos, yes, of course.

00:04:30.503 --> 00:04:33.506
Because there's certain things
that you can't do.

00:04:33.506 --> 00:04:34.640
Like, you can't --

00:04:34.640 --> 00:04:36.875
All right, so I did
this pyramid, right?

00:04:36.875 --> 00:04:38.978
I did this pyramid
with some girls.

00:04:38.978 --> 00:04:41.881
And the pyramid, we have to do
it less than 10 seconds

00:04:41.881 --> 00:04:43.950
