the beginning of the week,

00:04:53.792 --> 00:04:55.561
the day before, and the day of.

00:04:55.561 --> 00:04:58.264
So that's extra, the money...
-Yeah.

00:04:58.264 --> 00:05:00.366
-...spending in production.
-Oh, exactly.

00:05:00.366 --> 00:05:02.435
But didn't --
also, didn't you just --

00:05:02.435 --> 00:05:05.971
