But there was, like,
how many girls?

00:05:22.888 --> 00:05:24.290
Like 10 girls together.

00:05:24.290 --> 00:05:26.659
It cannot be more than
10 people in a room.

00:05:26.659 --> 00:05:30.729
Like, it's just --
the craziest protocols.

00:05:30.729 --> 00:05:32.664
The craziest.
-It's like, "No pyramid!

00:05:32.664 --> 00:05:34.433
Stop it!
Whoa. Licking?

00:05:34.433 --> 00:05:36.669
Oh, three of you
